  "scope": "Exact archived80-request/414-entry schedule. Fixed GPU graph work with native model and codec inputs prestaged onGPU. GPU-to-GPU input copies replace native wrapper CPU tensor creation/H2D; this intentionally isolates GPUsequence, not fullEngine host throughput. Packed prefill/single-step decode, no mixed/pipeline/HTTP/Python completion loop. PCM conversion and pinned D2H copy retained; no callback/thread delivery in timed work.",
  "limitations": [
    "One sequential diagnostic per mode; not a replicated performance estimate or service result.",
    "Fixed packed-prefill/single-step fixture contains no mixed or frame pipeline; current full-service timeline supplies those fractions separately.",
    "Stage events include input copies, graph work and retained validation copies. Codec events retain PCM conversion and pinned D2H.",
    "CPU submit timing can include CUDA queue backpressure/allocator wait. It does not measure Python-only work; no CPU per-step outputs or metadata are read in timed modes.",
    "Model-only and omitted-codec arithmetic are diagnostic counterfactuals, never serving proposals."
  ]
